        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="vuflKKwzMOme1BwdvtkB-19" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=0;" value="&lt;span class=&quot;iNqyIf&quot; data-sfc-cp=&quot;&quot; data-sfc-root=&quot;c&quot; data-complete=&quot;true&quot; style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); margin: 0px; border-bottom: 0px rgb(232, 234, 242);&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;rQesXe MPyX&quot; data-sfc-cp=&quot;&quot; data-sfc-root=&quot;c&quot; data-complete=&quot;true&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0px; border-bottom: 0px rgb(232, 234, 242);&quot;&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Helvetica&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;Интеграция нового финтех-сервиса&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;ol class=&quot;T9WCjf qkgVBf&quot; data-sfc-cp=&quot;&quot; data-sfc-root=&quot;c&quot; data-complete=&quot;true&quot; style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); margin: 12px 0px 16px; border-bottom: 0px rgb(232, 234, 242);&quot;&gt;&lt;li class=&quot;Z1qcYe&quot; data-sfc-cp=&quot;&quot; data-sfc-root=&quot;c&quot; data-hveid=&quot;CAAIEBAI&quot; data-complete=&quot;true&quot; data-sae=&quot;&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0px 0px 12px; border-bottom: 0px rgb(232, 234, 242);&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;iNqyIf&quot; data-sfc-cp=&quot;&quot; data-sfc-root=&quot;c&quot; data-complete=&quot;true&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0px; border-bottom: 0px rgb(232, 234, 242);&quot;&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Helvetica&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;Пациент хочет оформить медицинский кредит. Финтех-сервис запрашивает через Kafka историю оплат клиента из домена Медицины.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li class=&quot;Z1qcYe&quot; data-sfc-cp=&quot;&quot; data-sfc-root=&quot;c&quot; data-hveid=&quot;CAAIEBAJ&quot; data-complete=&quot;true&quot; data-sae=&quot;&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0px 0px 12px; border-bottom: 0px rgb(232, 234, 242);&quot;&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Helvetica&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;iNqyIf&quot; data-sfc-cp=&quot;&quot; data-sfc-root=&quot;c&quot; data-complete=&quot;true&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0px; border-bottom: 0px rgb(232, 234, 242);&quot;&gt;Скоринговый модуль банка принимает решение, открывает счет и публикует событие в топик&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;fintech-tx&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li class=&quot;Z1qcYe&quot; data-sfc-cp=&quot;&quot; data-sfc-root=&quot;c&quot; data-hveid=&quot;CAAIEBAK&quot; data-complete=&quot;true&quot; data-sae=&quot;&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0px; border-bottom: 0px rgb(232, 234, 242);&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;iNqyIf&quot; data-sfc-cp=&quot;&quot; data-sfc-root=&quot;c&quot; data-complete=&quot;true&quot; aria-owns=&quot;action-menu-parent-container&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0px; border-bottom: 0px rgb(232, 234, 242);&quot;&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Helvetica&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;Все финансовые транзакции изолированы в контуре Банка и не задействуют таблицы старого DWH.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ol&gt;" vertex="1">
